    <value>The genome viewer needs a Microsoft component</value>
  </data>
  <data name="ViewerRuntimeMissing_Body" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>The built-in genome viewer uses Microsoft's WebView2 Runtime, which is not installed on this computer. Install it, then open this run again.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="ViewerRuntimeMissing_Action" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Install the WebView2 Runtime</value>
  </data>
